config DATAFS_FS
	tristate "Data filesystem over TCP and BPF"
	depends on INET
	depends on BPF_SYSCALL
	depends on BPF_JIT
	select NETFS_SUPPORT
	help
	  datafs is an experimental read-only filesystem that uses netfslib for
	  regular-file reads and BPF struct_ops callbacks for protocol
	  framing and response decoding.  Ordinary operations use a bounded TCP
	  connection pool.

	  If unsure, say N.
